WEBVTT

00:02:28.394 --> 00:02:32.315
But thawing permafrost
also threatens everyone on the planet

00:02:32.315 --> 00:02:36.652
because it stores a massive amount
of ancient frozen carbon.

00:02:36.944 --> 00:02:38.279
And when that carbon thaws,

00:02:38.279 --> 00:02:41.449
it can be released into the atmosphere
as greenhouse gases,

00:02:41.449 --> 00:02:44.160
leading to more warming and more thaw.

00:02:46.245 --> 00:02:49.540
So let me place the magnitude
of this problem in perspective for you.

00:02:50.166 --> 00:02:51.792
By the end of this century,

00:02:51.792 --> 00:02:54.629
greenhouse gas emissions
from thawing permafrost

00:02:54.629 --> 00:02:59.592
may be on par with some of the world’s
leading greenhouse-gas-emitting nations,

00:02:59.592 --> 00:03:04.555
perhaps as large as or larger
than emissions from the United States,